<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>CHD API</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-base:        #0d1117;
        --bg-surface:     #161b22;
        --bg-elevated:    #1c2128;
        --bg-subtle:      #21262d;
        --border:         #30363d;
        --border-muted:   #21262d;
        --text-primary:   #e6edf3;
        --text-secondary: #8b949e;
        --text-muted:     #6e7681;
        --accent:         #388bfd;
        --accent-hover:   #58a6ff;
        --accent-dim:     rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.15);
        --success:        #3fb950;
        --get-color:      #3fb950;
        --get-dim:        rgba(63, 185, 80, 0.15);
        --radius-sm:      6px;
        --radius-md:      10px;
        --radius-lg:      16px;
      }

      *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

      body {
        font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg-base);
        color: var(--text-primary);
        min-height: 100vh;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      .page {
        max-width: 1280px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 24px 48px;
      }

      .topbar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 16px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      .topbar-logo {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        text-decoration: none;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }
      .topbar-logo svg { color: var(--accent); }

      .topbar-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 20px;
        margin-left: auto;
      }
      .topbar-links a {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .topbar-links a:hover { color: var(--accent-hover); }

      .page-header { margin-bottom: 36px; }

      .page-title {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }
      .page-title span { color: var(--accent); }

      .page-subtitle {
        margin-top: 8px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        max-width: 640px;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .section { margin-bottom: 40px; }

      .section-title {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }
      .section-title svg { color: var(--accent); }

      .section-desc {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .card-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .card {
        display: block;
        background: var(--bg-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 18px 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
        transition: border-color 0.15s, transform 0.15s, background 0.15s;
      }
      .card:hover {
        border-color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--bg-elevated);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }

      .card-featured {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-dim), var(--bg-surface));
        border-color: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.35);
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 20px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .card-featured .card-title { font-size: 1.05rem; }
      .card-featured-cta {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        background: var(--accent);
        color: #fff;
        padding: 8px 16px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .card-top {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .method-badge {
        font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', 'Consolas', monospace;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.03em;
        color: var(--get-color);
        background: var(--get-dim);
        border: 1px solid rgba(63, 185, 80, 0.3);
        padding: 2px 7px;
        border-radius: 20px;
      }

      .card-path {
        font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', 'Consolas', monospace;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        word-break: break-all;
      }

      .card-title {
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }

      .card-desc {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.45;
      }

      footer {
        margin-top: 48px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
      }
      footer a { color: var(--text-secondary); }

      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .page { padding: 0 16px 32px; }
        .page-title { font-size: 1.5rem; }
        .card-featured { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page">

      <nav class="topbar">
        <a href="/" class="topbar-logo">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/>
            <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/>
          </svg>
          CHD API
        </a>
        <div class="topbar-links">
          <a href="/api-docs">Swagger UI</a>
          <a href="/graph">Dashboards</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/arandadeduero/chd-api" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <header class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">CHD <span>API</span></h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">
          API REST para consultar datos de la Confederación Hidrográfica del Duero (CHD) desde el portal SAIH Duero:
          estaciones de aforo, mediciones históricas de nivel y caudal, y visualizaciones gráficas interactivas.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="card-grid">
          <a href="/api-docs" class="card card-featured">
            <div>
              <div class="card-title">Documentación interactiva (Swagger UI)</div>
              <div class="card-desc">Explora y prueba todos los endpoints de la API directamente desde el navegador.</div>
            </div>
            <span class="card-featured-cta">
              Abrir Swagger UI
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M4 17V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10"/><path d="M4 17h16v2H4z"/>
          </svg>
          APIs disponibles
        </h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Endpoints JSON. Referencia completa y esquemas en <a href="/api-docs" style="color: var(--accent-hover);">Swagger UI</a> o <a href="/openapi.json" style="color: var(--accent-hover);">/openapi.json</a>.</p>
        <div class="card-grid">
          <a href="/health" class="card">
            <div class="card-top"><span class="method-badge">GET</span></div>
            <div class="card-path">/health</div>
            <div class="card-desc" style="margin-top: 6px;">Estado del servidor y tiempo de actividad.</div>
          </a>
          <a href="/station/aforo/all" class="card">
            <div class="card-top"><span class="method-badge">GET</span></div>
            <div class="card-path">/station/aforo/all</div>
            <div class="card-desc" style="margin-top: 6px;">Listado de todas las estaciones de aforo.</div>
          </a>
          <a href="/station/aforo/EA013" class="card">
            <div class="card-top"><span class="method-badge">GET</span></div>
            <div class="card-path">/station/aforo/:id</div>
            <div class="card-desc" style="margin-top: 6px;">Tipos de medición disponibles para una estación.</div>
          </a>
          <a href="/station/aforo/EA013/nivel" class="card">
            <div class="card-top"><span class="method-badge">GET</span></div>
            <div class="card-path">/station/aforo/:id/:type</div>
            <div class="card-desc" style="margin-top: 6px;">Histórico de mediciones (nivel, caudal, ...) de una estación.</div>
          </a>
          <a href="/station/aforo/EA013/nivel/graph" class="card">
            <div class="card-top"><span class="method-badge">GET</span></div>
            <div class="card-path">/station/aforo/:id/:type/graph</div>
            <div class="card-desc" style="margin-top: 6px;">Gráfico HTML interactivo del histórico (Chart.js).</div>
          </a>
          <a href="/openapi.json" class="card">
            <div class="card-top"><span class="method-badge">GET</span></div>
            <div class="card-path">/openapi.json</div>
            <div class="card-desc" style="margin-top: 6px;">Especificación OpenAPI 3.0 en formato JSON.</div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/>
          </svg>
          Dashboards
        </h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Interfaces visuales para explorar los datos sin llamar a la API directamente.</p>
        <div class="card-grid">
          <a href="/graph" class="card">
            <div class="card-top"><span class="method-badge">GET</span></div>
            <div class="card-path">/graph</div>
            <div class="card-title" style="margin-top: 8px;">Estaciones de Aforo</div>
            <div class="card-desc">Listado buscable de todas las estaciones, con acceso directo a cada una.</div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer>
        <span>Confederación Hidrográfica del Duero · SAIH Duero</span>
        <span><a href="https://github.com/arandadeduero/chd-api" target="_blank" rel="noopener">arandadeduero/chd-api</a> en GitHub</span>
      </footer>

    </div>
  </body>
</html>
